      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Lisinopril:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " K-sparing diuretics raise hyperkalemia risk; NSAIDs raise renal-impairment risk and blunt the BP effect; lithium toxicity has been reported (monitor lithium levels); contraindicated w a neprilysin inhibitor (sacubitril); ⍉aliskiren in diabetes."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
